        <notes><![CDATA[
   file name: spring-aop-6.2.19.jar, spring-beans-6.2.19.jar, spring-context-6.2.19.jar,
   spring-core-6.2.19.jar, spring-expression-6.2.19.jar, spring-jcl-6.2.19.jar,
   spring-webmvc-6.2.19.jar
   Spring Framework CPE findings on the Spring Boot 3.5.16 managed version. The vulnerable usage
   patterns are not present in this service; fixed 6.2.x artifacts are not currently available OSS.
   ]]></notes>
